pnpm-lock.yaml.bak

# Not ignored: lib/ is committed on purpose.
# DeepSeek Harness loads a plugin's built entry (`main: ./lib/index.js`) and never
# builds it, so a GitHub-based install only works when the build output is in the
# repository. A linked checkout keeps its own node_modules; `pnpm pack`'s `prepack`
# rebuilds lib/ for registry and tarball installs. Run `pnpm build` before committing
# changes to src/.
